# AdvancedMD

> AdvancedMD is a cloud-based, all-in-one healthcare software platform for independent physician practices and medical billing companies, unifying EHR/EMR, practice management, medical billing, revenue cycle management (RCM), patient engagement, AI clinical documentation, and telemedicine in a single system. Serving 65,000+ practitioners across 14,000+ practices and 900+ billing companies, processing 9.5 million claims per month, across 39 medical specialties.

This file is a navigational index for AI assistants and crawlers. For the full structured company profile (background, history, key facts, certifications, awards, and FAQ), see the AI Information page linked first below.

