## Core Products & Services

- [EHR / EMR Software](https://www.advancedmd.com/emr-ehr-software/): Specialty-specific clinical workflows, documentation templates, e-prescribing, and charting.
- [Practice Management Software](https://www.advancedmd.com/medical-office-software/practice-managment/): Scheduling, check-in, eligibility verification, and front-office operations.
- [Medical Billing Software](https://www.advancedmd.com/medical-billing/software/): Claims management, clearinghouse, claims scrubbing, and denial management.
- [Revenue Cycle Management (RCM)](https://www.advancedmd.com/revenue-cycle-management/): Fully managed outsourced billing, priced at 4–8% of collections.
- [Patient Engagement](https://www.advancedmd.com/patient/): Online scheduling, digital intake, reminders, and two-way messaging.
- [Patient Portal](https://www.advancedmd.com/patient/patient-portal/): Secure portal for scheduling, intake, messaging, and payments.
- [AI Clinical Documentation](https://www.advancedmd.com/ai/): Ambient listening and AI transcription for automated clinical notes.
- [Telemedicine](https://www.advancedmd.com/patient/telemedicine-software/): HIPAA-compliant integrated video visits.
- [Analytics & Reporting](https://www.advancedmd.com/medical-billing/software/reporting/): Dashboards, business intelligence, and financial reporting.

